715060101,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1765455410,"text":"ホッセイニは、理論的に問題ないって言ってたよな？","nextNodeIds":[715060102]},{"nodeId":715060102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":810104290,"text":"スパイクで余計に黒泥が…","nextNodeIds":[715060103]},{"nodeId":715060103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"ホッセイニ","textMapHash":780271762,"text":"そうか、そういうことか…地面係数の変化を考えていなかった。これは予想外だ。","nextNodeIds":[715060104]},{"nodeId":715060104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3842713986,"text":"地面係数？","nextNodeIds":[715060105]},{"nodeId":715060105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"ホッセイニ","textMapHash":2945803330,"text":"そう、前の実験場は、そのほとんどが柔らかい土の上だった。","nextNodeIds":[715060106]},{"nodeId":715060106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"ホッセイニ","textMapHash":673721274,"text":"しかし層岩巨淵の場合、スパイクのエネルギーが伝わる媒介は土ではなく、また違った質と特性を持った岩だ。そのため、本来の計算結果に狂いが生じてしまった。","nextNodeIds":[715060107]},{"nodeId":715060107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"ホッセイニ","textMapHash":2694967082,"text":"やはり、真理は憶測で創り上げた想像の中には存在していない。現実でしっかりと検証を行うべきだったか。","nextNodeIds":[715060108]},{"nodeId":715060108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":252480274,"text":"検証するにしても危険だろ。それに…なんで黒泥が急にこんなに湧いたんだ？","nextNodeIds":[715060109]},{"nodeId":715060109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"ホッセイニ","textMapHash":2963575026,"text":"確かに、ここは鉱区から離れているから、黒泥はこうも湧かないはず…どうやら、事態は思ったより切迫しているようだ。","nextNodeIds":[715060110]},{"nodeId":715060110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"ホッセイニ","textMapHash":2761216514,"text":"それに、「プルシナスパイク」が黒泥の環境に影響を与えたということは、やはり推測通り、これは地脈に関する問題ということ。","nextNodeIds":[715060111]},{"nodeId":715060111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"ホッセイニ","textMapHash":2266584002,"text":"つまり、実験と実証の必要性を証明したということにならないだろうか？","nextNodeIds":[715060112]},{"nodeId":715060112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"ホッセイニ","textMapHash":600926730,"text":"ただ、もし私一人で試運転をしていたら、きっと魔物に襲われていただろう。","nextNodeIds":[715060113]},{"nodeId":715060113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"ホッセイニ","textMapHash":1030380250,"text":"ケガをするだけならまだしも、もし「プルシナスパイク」に深刻なダメージがあったら、フィルナス大先生や「妙論派」の学者たちにどう説明したらいいか…","nextNodeIds":[715060114]},{"nodeId":715060114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4176411450,"text":"自分のことをもっと考えたほうがいい。","nextNodeIds":[715060115]},{"nodeId":715060115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"ホッセイニ","textMapHash":2622665210,"text":"ふむ、今回の試運転で得られたデータは、計算結果の修正に役立ちそうだ。このパラメータによる干渉を解決する方法は…よし、四つもある。その中でもっとも効果的なのは、一つのはず。","nextNodeIds":[715060116]},{"nodeId":715060116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"ホッセイニ","textMapHash":2022799010,"text":"#{NICKNAME}、試運転に協力してくれて本当にありがとう。これから「プルシナスパイク」を再調整するつもりだ。","nextNodeIds":[715060117]},{"nodeId":715060117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"ホッセイニ","textMapHash":1693640450,"text":"しばらく経ったら、鉱区に運んで起動してみる。","nextNodeIds":[715060118,715060119]},{"nodeId":715060118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1240851634,"text":"鉱区に運ぶ？","nextNodeIds":[715060120]},{"nodeId":715060120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"ホッセイニ","textMapHash":3431345754,"text":"いや、元々私はヘディーヴと層岩巨淵の地元鉱夫を雇って、運んでもらうよう話し合っていた。","nextNodeIds":[715060121]},{"nodeId":715060121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"ホッセイニ","textMapHash":4045337690,"text":"だが、何人かの鉱夫は、私が鉱区に現れた黒泥を解決しようとしているのを聞くと、報酬はいらないと言ってきた。","nextNodeIds":[715060122]},{"nodeId":715060122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"ホッセイニ","textMapHash":4218233298,"text":"私はヘディーヴと一緒に、総務司にいる層岩巨淵を管理している沐寧さんに相談をした——このお金を補助金として彼らに配りたいと。","nextNodeIds":[715060123]},{"nodeId":715060123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"ホッセイニ","textMapHash":789470970,"text":"スパイクの運搬が終わった後、機器を起動する役目は君に任せよう。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":715060119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3320435346,"text":"一人で運ぶの？","nextNodeIds":[715060120]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7150601,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["30181"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":6,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_ENABLE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7150601],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"ホッセイニ","count":16},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","count":4},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","count":3}],"raw":{"ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_ALL","BEGCMMJKCFC":[],"BHCBFLFOGJN":0,"BPEIDGPCLGA":false,"CBBBCAKOFGO":38530598,"CHECNJEMEFE":{},"CJPLOBIFHLG":"MAINQUEST_TAG_ACTIVITY","CMDGLJAOFOJ":[],"EPJHBBICPCA":false,"FBEFCEJCBIK":{},"FFOAGHNMJKJ":0,"FNFALGGACGA":"","FOKHPBAGMPB":"","GBFMDJLKJBF":[71502],"GMENNHMBBOH":[],"HCJHEADFCAO":0,"IBEGAHMEABP":[{"<DLGBBMLABOA>k__BackingField":0,"ABDCADBLCFC":0,"AIMIPKGBAHC":"QuestDialogue/WQ/TheChasmChallenge/Q7150601","ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_HOST","AOLKCANJCMJ":15,"BKDENCDKDEE":"","BPIIFMJLJAJ":[],"DAMGEPEMGNO":false,"DBACCKDPONG":[],"DIAFFIANKPH":false,"DKOMBMCJMMN":false,"EFBOKHEHKJM":[],"EIDINNIHMHD":false,"EKANPNMEFMG":[],"ENDBMMDPPAH":[],"FALLCBHGKON":"LOGIC_NONE","GEPGLHFDBNF":[],"GLJMLHNKKKO":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","H